HST Office: HST Sheets has LAMBDA, ISOMITTED, MAP, REDUCE, SCAN, BYROW, BYCOL and MAKEARRAY, backported from
LibreOffice master (owner decision 2026-11-14: the LAMBDA family is in 1.0.2, backported rather than rewritten).

Upstream work (tdf#138749, tdf#164510, tdf#164507; MPL-2.0, authors Ben Urban, Tomaž Vajngerl, Caolán McNamara,
Xisco Fauli, Olivier Hallot, Stanislav Horacek, Neil Roberts), cherry-picked onto 26.8.1.1 + the HST series:
3bdd856e9 callables as first-class formula values (built-in, external and macro functions), 331e346fb LAMBDA and
ISOMITTED (LET rewritten on the same machinery), 76c9c81b0 BYCOL/BYROW/MAKEARRAY/MAP/REDUCE/SCAN, 9c34dddef,
cb9b0f455, 97b180f07 optional [parameters], d9241ddd7 _xlop. import, 227fd2650 _xleta. import, 0500f647f,
2cdb8ce0a, cd489d2a8 crash fixes, 88c38d10b, 5776da7d0 LAMBDA without parameters, cd0b10a6f robustness,
2e3ff9288 recursion depth per token iterator, ecac4d4e1 LET/LAMBDA name shadow checks, UI strings c3e8217a6,
e5386e95c, 86615b08b, 373c8e2aa, 33b183d2f, 3a0fabe6d, and the FunctionsTest documents 11ad7d61b + af21c2995.
Not taken: e1d69c459 (it fixes master's dynamic-array result analysis, which 26.8 does not have), upstream's
ucalc_formula2/subsequent_filters additions (they rely on master-only tests and an .xlsx fixture), and the
ARRAYTOTEXT commits (hst-sheets-excel-functions.patch already carries that function).
HST adaptations: the dispatch table that 3bdd856e9 moves into ScInterpreter::DispatchOpCode() keeps the
functions added by hst-sheets-excel-functions.patch, whose opcodes move behind ocScan (527-535); the iterator
keeps FrontPop(). Function names: UI/ODF COM.MICROSOFT.<NAME>, .xlsx _xlfn.<NAME>, parameters _xlpm./_xlop.,
built-in functions passed as values _xleta.<NAME>. Function Wizard and the new status-bar error text in
Vietnamese (translations/source/vi/sc/messages.po hunk against the pristine tarball).

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: CppunitTest_sc_lambda_functions_test, CppunitTest_sc_spreadsheet_functions_test (let.fods),
CppunitTest_sc_excelcompat_functions_test, tests/unit/test_sheets_lambda_functions.py,
tests/runtime/check-sheets-excel-functions.py.
